OL,6,
OL,7,FSapphire Greatorex, Ring's daughter,
OL,8,Fhas now called for tighter mental
OL,9,Fhealth restrictions after Donoher was
OL,10,Fgiven an indefinite hospital order on
OL,11,FTuesday, after pleading guilty to
OL,12,Fmanslaughter by reason of diminished
OL,13,Fresponsibility.
OL,15,F"I don't think it should be someone
OL,16,Flike me and the next person and the
OL,17,Fnext person saying the same things over
OL,18,Fand over again," she said.
